ything, each state resting on its own eyes; D25 web motion plays the keyframes in packages/shared/crew-motion.ts through the Web Animations API, no CSS keyframes; D28 reduced motion is the only off switch, no Animate avatars setting. D23 every thread row leads with the agent's avatar (P14 web, P15 iOS). D3, against the plan's recommendation, a one-time startup migration clears shared-glyph icons (Builder, Conductor, Designer, Reviewer, Usage scan on Ben's machines) and D26 drops colors outside the 14 (Builder Amber, Conductor Ink, Designer bucket in Amber). D27 tests sit at two seams: agentFace() in packages/shared and a test server over its own data folder, with no component tests. Supersedes ADR 0019's default avatars, the running ring and the corner diamond, and ADR 0020's initials fallback; the offered photo still wins. ADR 0021, spec #918, PRD #917, GLOSSARY (Avatar, Shape, Eyes).
